{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/4b654703acd0fd3d82ea8c64b8da990d.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play <strong>Bill</strong>, an ex-MMA champion turned billionaire, who has decided to cut himself off from the world by retreating to his <strong>private island</strong>. Unfortunately, he hadn't anticipated that his tranquility would be put to the test. On the same day, Bill was about to go <strong>into a rage</strong>! <strong>Young party people</strong> have landed on the beaches, an <strong>alien ship</strong> has crashed on the island, <strong>the undead</strong> have awakened, <strong>dragon</strong> and other <strong>monsters</strong> have appeared on the island, a mysterious <strong>virus</strong> has been spotted, the <strong>weather</strong> is acting up, etc. In short, it's time to put on the gloves and clean up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/c63601031f40a81f584f1fb6658540af.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place on a <strong>5 km\u00b2 island</strong>, which offers its share of caves (accessible or hidden), but also offers verticality (floating island, platforms, etc.). The island features <strong>a variety of different zones</strong>, including a volcano, snow-capped mountains, a desert, a secret hi-tech station, forests, beaches, lakes and rivers, a luxurious villa... The game features a <strong>day/night cycle</strong> and <strong>dynamic weather</strong>.  An important element of the game is the <strong>easter eggs</strong> hidden everywhere, with huge nods to <strong>80/90s</strong> and <strong>pop culture</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/d23c3c4c72f80e78e58af803fc8c1ea4.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/d23c3c4c72f80e78e58af803fc8c1ea4.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/d23c3c4c72f80e78e58af803fc8c1ea4.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/2a98cc865e19ad1facb0d6cf9844ac5f.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raging Bill is a <strong>TPS sandbox</strong> in a mini open world It features <strong>different gameplay styles</strong> (Shooter &amp; Melee Combat, Racing, Exploration, Loot, Bodycam, and more),</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get around the island more quickly, you'll have at your disposal a real hoverboard, zip lines, a boosted lawnmower, magic boots, jetpack, a raft, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You master <strong>kung fu</strong> like no one else, but nothing stops you from <strong>throwing whatever falls into your hands</strong> (coconuts, bombs, bottles, balloons, stones, ...). Also at your disposal are <strong>weapons</strong> such as a toy blaster, plasma gun, retro gun, mines, ... But will you be able to unlock the ultimate power, which will allow you to <strong>fly</strong> and master <strong>telekinesis</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/eb84eee904f945951b0cadf98f6e67b6.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/eb84eee904f945951b0cadf98f6e67b6.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/eb84eee904f945951b0cadf98f6e67b6.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>physics-based game</strong>. Do you like playing with <strong>ragdolls</strong>? Then you've come to the right place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is full of <strong>secret chests</strong> to find, where you can unlock <strong>cosmetic items</strong> (masks, hats, etc.), <strong>ammunition</strong> for your weapons, and other <strong>power-ups</strong>. A special chest will allow you to <strong>grow</strong> or <strong>shrink</strong> (and offers new gameplay possibilities), and other surprises to discover...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For collectors, <strong>24 magazines</strong> featuring the hero are hidden in the game. <strong>Dozens of lost bees</strong> that you must return to their 5-star hive. And don't forget the <strong>virus</strong> that's spread across the island: <strong>destroy them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/4c7d6f6ad80460d896c79099a1f11dcd.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has its share of <strong>puzzles</strong>, <strong>inaccessible areas</strong>,\u00a0and various <strong>parkours</strong> that you'll have to challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/a47b06cd7fe1c89fd60d1b9800b750d5.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/a47b06cd7fe1c89fd60d1b9800b750d5.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/a47b06cd7fe1c89fd60d1b9800b750d5.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a <strong>time trial</strong> enthusiast? Grab your <strong>remote-controlled car</strong> and speed around the island, don't hesitate to <strong>wreck</strong> everything along the way :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/5f0432885ff48b5515b69e96add6c631.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/5f0432885ff48b5515b69e96add6c631.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/5f0432885ff48b5515b69e96add6c631.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/88d659be91482b9b3b378b4891ff0cac.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses are also part of the game, so it's up to you to find their weak points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/39f74b629d2cd25657792e9bc209d611.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/39f74b629d2cd25657792e9bc209d611.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/39f74b629d2cd25657792e9bc209d611.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/23459ab76eed3a4d40a41ebc50ff0d0b.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole bunch of <strong>accessories are unlockable</strong> (via chests or other challenges). Hint: Some will give you <strong>advantages</strong> that shouldn't be overlooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/59f663b9bfd4a327f65a0921493aa98f.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/59f663b9bfd4a327f65a0921493aa98f.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/59f663b9bfd4a327f65a0921493aa98f.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3710470?t=1774262101","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/6df488835ce6826a2bb7fcf2468694bbd9b275cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774262101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/4e815e3218502124c8266a69149ec34d2639ab09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774262101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/4e815e3218502124c8266a69149ec34d2639ab09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774262101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3814080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Devlogs</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/56fc1a8bfb7b412b8f47d95c2eec66f7.avif?t=1774262101\" width=780 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New trailers &amp; devlogs are out!</strong><br>Want to follow the chaotic, over\u2011the\u2011top evolution of <strong>Raging Bill</strong> \ud83e\udd4a<br>\ud83d\udc49 Subscribe to our YouTube channel and follow us on social media so you don\u2019t miss anything!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/4b654703acd0fd3d82ea8c64b8da990d.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play <strong>Bill</strong>, an ex-MMA champion turned billionaire, who has decided to cut himself off from the world by retreating to his <strong>private island</strong>. Unfortunately, he hadn't anticipated that his tranquility would be put to the test. On the same day, Bill was about to go <strong>into a rage</strong>! <strong>Young party people</strong> have landed on the beaches, an <strong>alien ship</strong> has crashed on the island, <strong>the undead</strong> have awakened, <strong>dragon</strong> and other <strong>monsters</strong> have appeared on the island, a mysterious <strong>virus</strong> has been spotted, the <strong>weather</strong> is acting up, etc. In short, it's time to put on the gloves and clean up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/c63601031f40a81f584f1fb6658540af.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place on a <strong>5 km\u00b2 island</strong>, which offers its share of caves (accessible or hidden), but also offers verticality (floating island, platforms, etc.). The island features <strong>a variety of different zones</strong>, including a volcano, snow-capped mountains, a desert, a secret hi-tech station, forests, beaches, lakes and rivers, a luxurious villa... The game features a <strong>day/night cycle</strong> and <strong>dynamic weather</strong>.  An important element of the game is the <strong>easter eggs</strong> hidden everywhere, with huge nods to <strong>80/90s</strong> and <strong>pop culture</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/d23c3c4c72f80e78e58af803fc8c1ea4.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/d23c3c4c72f80e78e58af803fc8c1ea4.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/d23c3c4c72f80e78e58af803fc8c1ea4.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/2a98cc865e19ad1facb0d6cf9844ac5f.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raging Bill is a <strong>TPS sandbox</strong> in a mini open world It features <strong>different gameplay styles</strong> (Shooter &amp; Melee Combat, Racing, Exploration, Loot, Bodycam, and more),</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get around the island more quickly, you'll have at your disposal a real hoverboard, zip lines, a boosted lawnmower, magic boots, jetpack, a raft, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You master <strong>kung fu</strong> like no one else, but nothing stops you from <strong>throwing whatever falls into your hands</strong> (coconuts, bombs, bottles, balloons, stones, ...). Also at your disposal are <strong>weapons</strong> such as a toy blaster, plasma gun, retro gun, mines, ... But will you be able to unlock the ultimate power, which will allow you to <strong>fly</strong> and master <strong>telekinesis</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/eb84eee904f945951b0cadf98f6e67b6.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/eb84eee904f945951b0cadf98f6e67b6.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/eb84eee904f945951b0cadf98f6e67b6.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>physics-based game</strong>. Do you like playing with <strong>ragdolls</strong>? Then you've come to the right place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is full of <strong>secret chests</strong> to find, where you can unlock <strong>cosmetic items</strong> (masks, hats, etc.), <strong>ammunition</strong> for your weapons, and other <strong>power-ups</strong>. A special chest will allow you to <strong>grow</strong> or <strong>shrink</strong> (and offers new gameplay possibilities), and other surprises to discover...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For collectors, <strong>24 magazines</strong> featuring the hero are hidden in the game. <strong>Dozens of lost bees</strong> that you must return to their 5-star hive. And don't forget the <strong>virus</strong> that's spread across the island: <strong>destroy them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/4c7d6f6ad80460d896c79099a1f11dcd.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has its share of <strong>puzzles</strong>, <strong>inaccessible areas</strong>,\u00a0and various <strong>parkours</strong> that you'll have to challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/a47b06cd7fe1c89fd60d1b9800b750d5.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/a47b06cd7fe1c89fd60d1b9800b750d5.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/a47b06cd7fe1c89fd60d1b9800b750d5.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a <strong>time trial</strong> enthusiast? Grab your <strong>remote-controlled car</strong> and speed around the island, don't hesitate to <strong>wreck</strong> everything along the way :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/5f0432885ff48b5515b69e96add6c631.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/5f0432885ff48b5515b69e96add6c631.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/5f0432885ff48b5515b69e96add6c631.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/88d659be91482b9b3b378b4891ff0cac.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses are also part of the game, so it's up to you to find their weak points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/39f74b629d2cd25657792e9bc209d611.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/39f74b629d2cd25657792e9bc209d611.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/39f74b629d2cd25657792e9bc209d611.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/23459ab76eed3a4d40a41ebc50ff0d0b.webp?t=1774262101\" width=615 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole bunch of <strong>accessories are unlockable</strong> (via chests or other challenges). Hint: Some will give you <strong>advantages</strong> that shouldn't be overlooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/59f663b9bfd4a327f65a0921493aa98f.poster.avif?t=1774262101\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/59f663b9bfd4a327f65a0921493aa98f.webm?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/extras/59f663b9bfd4a327f65a0921493aa98f.mp4?t=1774262101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["ARTPUNK STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710470/55692b620deabfc63488c653a0963c10cbe7dd10/header.jpg?t=1774262101","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</